<h1 style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #15181f;">Confirm your email</h1>

<p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #15181f;">
  Welcome to SRO Labs! Confirm your email address to verify your account and
  start saving builds.
</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= link_to "Confirm my email",
              @confirmation_url,
              style:
                "display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; " \
                  "background: #d4a847; color: #0c0e12; font-family: sans-serif; " \
                  "font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none;" %>
</p>

<p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5c6270;">
  If the button doesn't work, paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <%= @confirmation_url %>
</p>

<p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5c6270;">
  This link expires in 24 hours. If you didn't create an account, you can
  ignore this email.
</p>
